 "pattern": "DP on the last move (Fibonacci)",
 "statement": "You are climbing a staircase with `n` stairs. Each move you can climb **1 or 2** stairs. In how many distinct ways can you reach the top?",
 "example": {
  "input": "n = 5",
  "output": "8",
  "why": "The counts for stairs 1 to 5 are 1, 2, 3, 5, 8 — each is the sum of the two before it."
 },
